{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17966","headline":"古风 · 韩愈","name":"古风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日曷不乐，幸时不用兵。\n无曰既蹙矣，乃尚可以生。\n彼州之赋，去汝不顾。\n此州之役，去我奚适。\n一邑之水，可走而违。\n天下汤汤，曷其而归。\n好我衣服，甘我饮食。\n无念百年，聊乐一日。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}